{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"哥林多前書","commonName":"哥林多前書","title":"哥林多前書","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"0bb2df52ecc035daf061ff19f8f15532627b064d54d80c5599126c0ead143f8d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["祭過偶像的食物"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["論到祭偶像之物，我們曉得我們都有知識。但知識是叫人自高自大，惟有愛心能造就人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["若有人以為自己知道甚麼，按他所當知道的，他仍是不知道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["若有人愛上帝，這人乃是上帝所知道的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["論到吃祭偶像之物，我們知道偶像在世上算不得甚麼，也知道上帝只有一位，再沒有別的上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["雖有稱為神的，或在天，或在地，就如那許多的神，許多的主；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["然而我們只有一位上帝，就是父－萬物都本於他；我們也歸於他－並有一位主，就是耶穌基督－萬物都是藉着他有的；我們也是藉着他有的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但人不都有這等知識。有人到如今因拜慣了偶像，就以為所吃的是祭偶像之物。他們的良心既然軟弱，也就污穢了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["其實食物不能叫上帝看中我們，因為我們不吃也無損，吃也無益。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["只是你們要謹慎，恐怕你們這自由竟成了那軟弱人的絆腳石。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["若有人見你這有知識的，在偶像的廟裏坐席，這人的良心若是軟弱，豈不放膽去吃那祭偶像之物嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因此，基督為他死的那軟弱弟兄，也就因你的知識沉淪了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你們這樣得罪弟兄們，傷了他們軟弱的良心，就是得罪基督。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["所以，食物若叫我弟兄跌倒，我就永遠不吃肉，免得叫我弟兄跌倒了。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}